  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37781110",
      "title": "Understanding Variations, Upscaling & Regenerations",
      "sourceHash": "a63554fcd87861cd684d15f4cbbbff831387625cb713890cef2c4449345a3ab0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.53,
          "en": "I mentioned that images are created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.53,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "in a so-called grid of four images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 10.56,
          "en": "The images can be referred to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.56,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "by numbers one, two, three, four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.83,
          "end": 16.53,
          "en": "Image one is always the one at the left top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.53,
          "end": 18.69,
          "en": "Then we have image two next to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.69,
          "end": 21.003,
          "en": "image three and image four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.83,
          "end": 26.04,
          "en": "We have three ways to interact with this grid now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.04,
          "end": 29.1,
          "en": "or with these images inside the grid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.1,
          "end": 33.36,
          "en": "One option is the regenerate option right here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 37,
          "en": "We have the upscale option for specific images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.01,
          "end": 42.573,
          "en": "and we have the variation option also for specific images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.44,
          "end": 46.47,
          "en": "Let's get started with the regeneration of images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.47,
          "end": 48.75,
          "en": "so with this button right here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.75,
          "end": 53.75,
          "en": "As ChatGPT, Midjourney has a randomness built into it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.54,
          "end": 58.53,
          "en": "This means if you're using the same prompt again and again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.53,
          "end": 62.01,
          "en": "you will never get exactly the same results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.01,
          "end": 65.64,
          "en": "and this regenerate button does exactly that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 65.64,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "It runs the same prompt again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 70.41,
          "en": "and therefore provides different results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.41,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "You never lose your initial result though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 76.68,
          "en": "So if I now press this regenerate button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.68,
          "end": 79.98,
          "en": "you see a new answer is created by the bot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.98,
          "end": 82.803,
          "en": "the initial images remain unchanged.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.73,
          "end": 86.61,
          "en": "And now we get another grid with four images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.61,
          "end": 88.95,
          "en": "but these images look quite different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.95,
          "end": 91.563,
          "en": "than the ones we saw with our initial prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.7,
          "end": 94.62,
          "en": "The left one is our grid we got",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.62,
          "end": 96.57,
          "en": "when we ran the prompt initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.57,
          "end": 98.07,
          "en": "the right grid is the one we got",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.07,
          "end": 100.56,
          "en": "with the regeneration process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.56,
          "end": 103.68,
          "en": "And as you see, both grids obviously contain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.68,
          "end": 105.87,
          "en": "the core idea of our prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.87,
          "end": 108.06,
          "en": "an island with beach and the sunshine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.06,
          "end": 110.91,
          "en": "but the outcome looks quite different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 112.8,
          "en": "So instead of copying and pasting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.8,
          "end": 114.21000000000001,
          "en": "the prompt again and again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.21000000000001,
          "end": 116.91,
          "en": "you can just regenerate the images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.91,
          "end": 120.69,
          "en": "if the initial result didn't completely satisfy you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.69,
          "end": 122.64,
          "en": "Obviously you should always consider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.64,
          "end": 126.24,
          "en": "fine-tuning your prompt, adding more keywords and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.24,
          "end": 129.603,
          "en": "But as mentioned, this will be covered in the next module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.71,
          "end": 133.2,
          "en": "The next option are variations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 138.2,
          "en": "Variations allow you to generate a grid of four images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.32999999999998,
          "end": 140.7,
          "en": "based on an image you selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.7,
          "end": 145.26,
          "en": "So for example, I could go back to my initial grid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.26,
          "end": 148.86,
          "en": "and take this fourth image down here, so this one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.86,
          "end": 152.67000000000002,
          "en": "and now create a variation based on this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.67000000000002,
          "end": 156.15,
          "en": "So Midjourney uses the parameters, the looks so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 158.07,
          "en": "of this image it created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.07,
          "end": 161.46,
          "en": "and now tries to create four new images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.46,
          "end": 162.93,
          "en": "which look quite similar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.93,
          "end": 165.57,
          "en": "but which have some detailed changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.57,
          "end": 168.03300000000002,
          "en": "So if you have a look at this image we created,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.11,
          "end": 171.78,
          "en": "you see that we have differences regarding the clouds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.78,
          "end": 174,
          "en": "regarding the waves,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174,
          "end": 177.15,
          "en": "regarding the stones that we can see at the beach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.15,
          "end": 180.54,
          "en": "So the general look of the image remains unchanged,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.54,
          "end": 184.233,
          "en": "but we change slight details inside this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.03,
          "end": 189.36,
          "en": "And this already brings us to the last core option here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.36,
          "end": 191.31,
          "en": "and this is the upscale option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.31,
          "end": 194.133,
          "en": "so the U for specific images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.24,
          "end": 199.38,
          "en": "Initially, upscale had two main purposes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.38,
          "end": 201.45,
          "en": "The first purpose is to isolate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 203.67000000000002,
          "en": "the specific image from the grid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.67000000000002,
          "end": 205.77,
          "en": "to allow you to download the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.77,
          "end": 208.353,
          "en": "and to further use it in your projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.19,
          "end": 211.35,
          "en": "The second purpose was to upscale",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.35,
          "end": 213.183,
          "en": "the resolution of the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.07999999999998,
          "end": 217.29,
          "en": "As mentioned, with the latest Midjourney versions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.29,
          "end": 220.17000000000002,
          "en": "images by default always have a resolution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.17000000000002,
          "end": 224.31,
          "en": "of 1024 times 1024 pixels",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.31,
          "end": 227.73,
          "en": "and this resolution remains unchanged",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.73,
          "end": 231,
          "en": "even after the upscale option was applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231,
          "end": 234.63,
          "en": "So if in our upscale, maybe not one of these images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234.63,
          "end": 238.82999999999998,
          "en": "instead I wanna have a more realistic looking one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.82999999999998,
          "end": 240.75,
          "en": "maybe this first one here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 240.75,
          "end": 243.18,
          "en": "So if I upscale this image now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.18,
          "end": 247.53,
          "en": "I once again get the image created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.53,
          "end": 251.04,
          "en": "at the bottom of my chat now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.04,
          "end": 254.97,
          "en": "You see that the image can be opened in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.97,
          "end": 258.753,
          "en": "but the resolution is the same that we have inside the grid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 259.68,
          "end": 262.66,
          "en": "So if you compare this size of the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 263.76,
          "end": 266.34,
          "en": "with the one in here, there is no difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 266.34,
          "end": 269.283,
          "en": "So it's all about isolating the image here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 270.87,
          "end": 273.33,
          "en": "There are ways to change the resolution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 273.33,
          "end": 276.36,
          "en": "and the aspect ratio and zone of our images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 276.36,
          "end": 278.1,
          "en": "but once again, this will be covered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 278.1,
          "end": 279.603,
          "en": "a bit later in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.86,
          "end": 284.04,
          "en": "However, after upscaling our image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.04,
          "end": 286.42,
          "en": "we got more options available down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 287.37,
          "end": 289.38,
          "en": "and these options are something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 289.38,
          "end": 292.08299999999997,
          "en": "we should have a closer look at as a next step.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
